de pro like  controllers for playstation but this  will be the first official sony device  no price or release date were given  which is unfortunate because this  controller will be great for playing war  zone 2.0 which seemingly contains that  rumored dmz mode the esrb has posted its  ratings description for call of duty war  zone 2.0 and among other things the  listing contains a reference to dmz the  ratings description specifically  mentions how players can take part in a  variety of multiplayer combat events  including battle royale blunder style  skirmishes and dmz dmz has been  something of an open secret for a while  now before this nfl players mentioned  the unannounced mode before deleting the  references to it dmz is rumored to be an  extraction-based mode inspired by escape  from tarkov leaks have described dmz as  a open world mode with a mix of battle  royale and survival game elements and  the mode has reportedly been in  development for four years it was also  rumored that dmz might be set for a  standalone release in 2023 but that is  apparently not the case hit the comments  and let us know your favorite moment  from opening night live and i'll see you  again soon
 

